      <div class="issue-summary"><article><span>待确认</span><strong>8</strong><small>2 条即将超时</small></article><article><span>处置中</span><strong>12</strong><small>平均耗时 18 分钟</small></article><article><span>待复核</span><strong>5</strong><small>今日已关闭 21 条</small></article><article class="danger"><span>SLA 风险</span><strong>3</strong><small>需立即关注</small></article></div>
      <section class="panel issue-process"><div class="process-copy"><span>当前流程阶段</span><strong>处理处置</strong><small>确认异常信息后，执行退款、补账或技术排查</small></div><pm-steps v-model="issueStep" :options="issueSteps" is-align-center /></section>
